      "html": "<ul><li>Origin: North America</li><li>Growth rate: medium</li><li>Height: 20–30+ cm (average after two months in the tank)</li><li>Light demand: low</li><li>CO2 demand: low</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "maintenance",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Eleocharismontevidensis(132D)/4573",
      "html": "<p>This American Eleocharis has a fresh grass green colour and grows to be 20-40 cm high. It is basic and low maintenance. Each straw is only a few millimetres thick and the plant maintains an open form of growth. It is suitable as a background plant, and can further be planted in front and in the centre of the aquarium, in transparent wads, in order to create depth and perspective.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Eleocharismontevidensis(132D)/4573",
      "html": "<p>The plant spreads through runners, which occasionally have to be trimmed and may be planted elsewhere.</p>"
    }
  ],
